==Hindi==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sa|hi}} {{term|परम्|lang=hi|tr=''param'', ultimate|lang=sa}} + {{term|आत्मन्|tr=''ātman'', soul|lang=sa}}

===Noun===
{{hi-noun|g=m|tr=paramātmā|ur=پرماتما}}

# [[God]], [[supreme being]]
#: {{Deva|'''परमात्मा''' नित्य, अविनाशी, सर्वव्यापक और सर्वशक्तिमान है।|}}
#: '''God''' is eternal, indestructible, all-pervading and all-powerful.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|hi|भगवान्|tr=bhagvān}}
* {{l|hi|ईश्वर|tr=īśvar}}

